title: Remove pallet::getter usage from pallet-staking-async-preset-store
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Replaces the `#[pallet::getter]` attribute of `pallet-staking-async-preset-store` with an
    explicit public function on `Pallet<T>`. `preset()` keeps its signature, so no changes are
    needed downstream.
crates:
- name: pallet-staking-async-preset-store
  bump: minor
